{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"31"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この際、乃木坂４６は「すっぴんアイドルグループ」として活動して行ったらどうだろ？\n（一部から猛反発あるかもｗ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなは素でも全然可愛いから問題ないけれどもー\nひめたんが恥ずかしいのでやめておきます(*/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"32"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京に来る時、メンバーに広島の御土産はあげました？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー全員にはあげたことないけどー…\n地方組の子にはホテルのお部屋をまわって配ったことはありますよ♪\nもみじまんじゅうだったかなー\n今度機会があればみんなに差し入れしておきますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"33"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島の名物料理って何！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島といえば\nお好み焼き・カキフライ・もみじまんじゅう!ほかにもいっぱいあるよー\nもみじまんじゅうはあげもみじのチーズ味がおすすめ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"34"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの広島のおすすめはー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べ物のほかにはね\n宮島の水中花火大会と今なら紅葉谷公園は見るべきっ\n有名人はPerfumeさん、綾瀬はるかさんなどなど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんとまあや(和田まあやchan)も続きますよーふぁいとっ(=・ω・)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"35"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京に来て広島とここが違うな～とか思った所はありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人多い、ビル高い、電車が長い!!!!広島で電車といえば市電だからね\n東京でいうところの電車はＪＲって呼んで区別してます\nしかも、４両くらいしかないので　わら\n山手線乗った時にめっちゃ感動しましたよ!\n終わりはあるの？と言った感じ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"36"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛行機乗るのって怖くないですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛行機は耳が痛くなるのが大変かなーとは思うけど\n離陸で体がかたむく感じは好きっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"37"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京へは仕事だけど、ディズニー行きたくなったりする？(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"するするー\nいつかメンバーに連れてってもらいたいです♪\n一緒に行くひとー？！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"38"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"移動中に出会ったおもしろい人とかいませんか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ会ったことないかなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"39"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高所恐怖症ですか？大丈夫なら東京スカイツリーに挑戦してみてね(^o^)／わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全員平気!むしろひめたんはテンション上がる人ですよー\n教えてくださってありがとうございます(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"40"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学生チームのイベントが、待ち遠しいです。いつ頃でしょう？\nその時には、新しい相棒ちゃんに会えるかな、楽しみです！\n名前は？公募かな？公募するなら、写メアップして下さい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学生イベントはいつでしょう(。・ω・。)ひめたんも楽しみですっ\n新しい仲間は、そのイベントで使うかどうかわからんけどー…\n名前募集ちゅ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"41"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自撮り撮るにあたってのｱﾄﾞﾊﾞｲｽ\n・白い壁を後ろにして撮る\n・45ﾟから撮る\n・なるべく明るい部屋で撮る\n・ｾﾛﾊﾝﾃｰﾌﾟをｼｬｯﾀｰに貼って撮る\n(少しぼやけて盛れる)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/01/22/kirihime020.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ｱﾄﾞﾊﾞｲｽを参考に↑の写メとってみました。どうかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"42"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの相棒？のおさるさんの人形のお名前はありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お見立て会の時は「おさるさん」って呼んでたんだけど\nあのあと握手会の時に「モンチー」ってお名前を付けてくださったので\nモンチーって覚えてあげてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"43"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イベントの自主練は腹話術かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやいやっ今回は腹話術を封印してー…\nいや、これ以上言うのやめておきます。本番をお楽しみに♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"44"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ以来、腹話術は上達したかなっ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そいえばあれからモンチーに会ってない...\nモンチー元気かな('`)わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"45"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島弁てめちゃかわいくない?イベントでも広島弁話してほしいっ(*´∀｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんまにー？？広島弁ほめてもらうの嬉しいっ♪ありがとうございます!\n今度ライブとかの機会があったらひめたんの生方言、チェックしてみてね★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"46"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん豆腐食べれますかｗ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豆腐好きですよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"47"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめちゃんから見て、歌やダンスが上手いメンバーは乃木坂46にいますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんからみてですか？\nみんな上手なんですよこれがっ!\nんー歌だったらろってぃー(川村真洋chan)、まいやん(白石麻衣chan)、\nいくたどん(生田絵梨花chan)♪\nダンスはろってぃー(川村真洋chan)、ひなちま(樋口日奈chan)とかカッコいいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"48"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーディション合格して、周りの反応はどう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな応援してくれてて心強いです☆★\n東京いる時にもメールくれたり、ホームページ遊びに来てくれたり。\n純粋にメンバーのファンになった子もいるみたいー(o>ω<o)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"49"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"科目の「技家」は家庭科のことかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴんぽーん♪正確に言うなら\n技術＋家庭科÷２＝技家!!\nとひめたんが勝手に略しました(`・ω・)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"50"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは高校進学は地元？都内？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"都内...の予定。\n今は思い出作りに励む毎日を過ごしておりますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"51"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りくろーおじさんはめっちゃおいしいね。\nもちっこきなこもおいしいから食べてみて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"52"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りくろーおじさんの　キナコまぶした団子みたいな\nお菓子あるんだけど、それが有名らしいよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちっこきなこ!名前めっちゃかわいいですね(*/ω＼*)\n覚えておきまーす"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"53"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嫌いな物、好きな物教えてください。食べ物以外もね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お菓子、オムライス、お好み焼き\nジャッキーちゃん、\n歌うこと、ダンスすること、お話しすること\n乃木坂のみんな、クラスのみんな\n乃木坂ブログに遊びにきて下さるみなさんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嫌い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/fish.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピーマン、魚介類のみんな、すっぱいもの\n数学、理科、走ること、鉄棒←わら\n睡魔、テスト、怪談、階段!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"54"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな花って何ですか？(*^ω^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マーガレットってお花知ってますかねー？\nひめたんが小さい頃仲良くしてたくまのお人形さんに\n「マーガレットちゃん」ってお名前付けてたくらいだから(^^)\nんーお花は基本好き♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"55"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの好きなアーティスト教えてくださーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルだったらＡＫＢさん、ももクロＺさん、\nアーティストだったらGReeeeNさん、\n尊敬するのはPerfumeさん(*/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"56"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪は美味しい食べ物多くて楽しいよね！特にお好み焼きが好きなんだけど、\nひめたんはやっぱ広島風が好きなのかなあ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは広島風派ですねー\n今度機会があったら\n関西風と広島風の両方を焼いて食べ比べしてみて下さい美味しいからっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"57"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは家でお好み焼きを食べたりするのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べますよ^^\nお店でテイクアウトか配達も頼むけど、おうちで作ることが多いかなー\nホットプレート１台あれば、お好み焼きも焼きそばもたこ焼きも\nぜーんぶ出来ますよっ万能万能♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"58"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"因みにひめたんは勿論お好み焼きは好きだよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえーす!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"59"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お料理とかするんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー...('`;)ほっとんどしないです。\nバレンタイン前と、たまにお弁当を作るのと、たまーにままを手伝う程度。\nでもお好み焼きは１人で焼けますよん♪数少ないレパートリーの１っ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"60"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん独自のお好み焼きの食べ方って、何かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーズをのせるくらいかな？\nあとは、いか天は入れないんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん大図鑑１だよ（2011年11月～）"}],"source":"archive"}